OL,3,GNEWSAAccessible space award winner
OL,4,Ablocked from stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disability campaigner has spoken of
OL,7,Fher frustration after she could not go
OL,8,Fon stage to receive an award after
OL,9,F"reasonable adjustment was not made"
OL,10,Ffor her wheelchair.
OL,12,FJulie Fernandez, an access coordinator
OL,13,Fat Peterborough Presents, was
OL,14,Frecognised at the Cambridgeshire
OL,15,FChamber of Commerce Awards for her work
OL,16,Fmaking workspaces inclusive and
OL,17,Faccessible.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
