PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1790664947
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAccessible space award winner
OL,4,Ablocked from stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, she said she felt disappointed
OL,7,Fand embarrassed when she could not
OL,8,Fcollect the accolade in her wheelchair
OL,9,Fon Thursday and said more work and
OL,10,Feducation is needed.
OL,12,FCambridgeshire Chamber of Commerce CEO
OL,13,FCharlotte Horobin said: "We are
OL,14,Fdisappointed that on this occasion we
OL,15,Fwere unable to meet the standard Ms
OL,16,FFernandez rightly expected. We
OL,17,Frecognise there is more we can do."
